ail.voyage/en/blog/la-circumetnea-etna-sicile","https://lovetravellingblog.com/2019/10/08/day-5-a-ride-on-the-circumetnea-railway-around-mt-etna-sicily/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Summit crater trek with a volcano guide","type":"trail","detail":"Cable car and 4x4 from Rifugio Sapienza to about 2,800 m, then a guided walk to the rim of Bocca Nuova near 3,300 m with views to the Aeolians.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://www.getyourguide.com/catania-l258/etna-summit-craters-trekking-with-volcano-guide-3350mt-t227776/","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":22,"urls":["https://www.getyourguide.com/catania-l258/etna-summit-craters-trekking-with-volcano-guide-3350mt-t227776/","https://www.funiviaetna.com/","https://www.earthtrekkers.com/mount-etna/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Silvestri craters loop","type":"trail","detail":"Free, easy path around the 1892 Silvestri craters beside Rifugio Sapienza; red cinder rims and Valle del Bove views without a guide.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":22,"urls":["https://www.outdooractive.com/en/route/hiking-trail/province-of-catania/crateri-silvestri-silvestri-craters/46796753/","https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/how-to-hike-mount-etna-sicily","https://theculturetrip.com/europe/italy/articles/the-essential-guide-to-hiking-mount-etna-sicily"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Lava tube caves","type":"activity","detail":"Guided tours duck into tunnels left by old flows, from roadside caves near the south side to the 2002 eruption tube, helmet and torch supplied.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":22,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/how-to-hike-mount-etna-sicily","https://travellemming.com/perspectives/guided-day-trip-mount-etna-sicily/","https://livtours.com/tours/private-mount-etna-tour-with-lunch-wine-tasting/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Valle del Bove viewpoint hike","type":"trail","detail":"Walks on the eastern flank overlook Etna's giant collapsed cald